  "description": "UniversalDataAccess is a versatile and extensible NuGet package designed to perform CRUD operations on any table in any relational database. It allows developers to easily integrate dynamic data management without having to create specific models or write repetitive SQL code.\n\nThis package is ideal for scenarios where the structure of tables is unknown in advance, or for tools that require universal database operations.",
